-- σ/(ξ+1) − p (W = (ξ+1)^σ e^{−pξ}), σ = R/p − 1, and x = (ξ−1)/(ξ+1) (dx/dξ = d1 = 2/(ξ+1)², d²x/dξ² = d2 = −4/(ξ+1)³),
-- divided by W, has at F_xx, F_x and F the coefficients (ξ²−1)d1², (ξ²−1)(d2 + 2ωd1) + 2ξd1 and (ξ²−1)(ω′ + ω²) + 2ξω +
-- 2Rξ − p²ξ² − A (ω′ = −σ/(ξ+1)²), which are x(1−x)², 1 + (2σ−2−4p)x + (1−2σ)x² and σ²x − c with c = p² − 2R + 2p + A − σ.
-- Each difference times a power of (ξ+1) is a polynomial of degree at most 4 in ξ, 2 in p, 2 in σ and 1 in A, so it is
-- zero when it vanishes on ξ ∈ {2 … 6}, p ∈ {1, 2, 3}, σ ∈ {0, 1, 2}, A ∈ {0, 1} (`sub-grid`)
